    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR is part of my work to make sure all Wasm pages have working BCD and display it properly in their \"Specifications\" and \"Browser compatibility\" sections.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In particular, this PR updates all the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebAssembly/Reference/SIMD/bitwise\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wasm SIMD bitwise instruction</a> pages so they will properly display the BCD/spec data added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4931528315\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30092\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30092/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30092\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30092</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44855",
            "title": "Update Wasm SIMD bitwise instruction pages to display BCD and specs",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-20T18:03:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-20T18:01:07.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR is part of my work to make sure all Wasm pages have working BCD and display it properly in their \"Specifications\" and \"Browser compatibility\" sections.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In particular, this PR updates all the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebAssembly/Reference/SIMD/arithmetic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wasm SIMD arithmetic instruction</a> pages so they will properly display the BCD/spec data added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4930177959\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30091\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30091/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30091\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30091</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44854",
            "title": "Update Wasm SIMD arithmetic instruction pages to display BCD and specs",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-20T15:33:51.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-20T15:32:04.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR is part of my work to make sure all Wasm pages have working BCD and display it properly in their \"Specifications\" and \"Browser compatibility\" sections.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In particular, this PR updates all the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebAssembly/Reference/Definitions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wasm numeric instruction</a> pages so they will properly display the BCD/spec data added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4913105745\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30073\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30073/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30073\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30073</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">While I was here, I also updated all the pages so that they refer to the type of instruction (numeric) in the page title, and link to the numeric instructions landing page in their opening sentence. This makes them more consistent both with the rest of the Wasm reference material, and with MDN as a whole.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44853",
            "title": "Update Wasm numeric instructions pages to display BCD and specs",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-20T14:05:07.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-20T14:03:15.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Created <code class=\"notranslate\">link-parameters</code> CSS property page</li>\n<li>Created <code class=\"notranslate\">param()</code> CSS function page</li>\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;dashed-ident&gt;</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">env()</code> CSS value page</li>\n<li>Added example to <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;dashed-ident&gt;</code> page</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Working on <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44466\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44466/hovercard\">MDN issue #44466</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30088\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30088/hovercard\">BCD PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29909\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29909/hovercard\">Associated BCD PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1082\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1082/hovercard\">Data PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44851\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/44851/hovercard\">Firefox Release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
