            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR is part of my work to make sure all Wasm pages have working BCD and display it properly in their \"Specifications\" and \"Browser compatibility\" sections.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In particular, this PR updates all the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebAssembly/Reference/Memory\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wasm memory instruction</a> pages so they will properly display the BCD/spec data added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4912417213\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30072\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30072/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30072\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30072</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
