        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR includes a complete revision of four existing pages:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>column-rule</li>\n<li>column-rule-style</li>\n<li>column-rule-width</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Gaps\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS gaps module page</a> is already live.<br>\nThat previous PR included the task of \"Update pages to correct module (gap has been moved from mod to mod)\"</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This starts the section of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4718339915\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/238\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/project/issues/238/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/238\">openwebdocs/project#238</a> of \"Update pages to new definition\"</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44755",
            "title": "Page updates: column-rule-*",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-18T22:57:11.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-16T19:49:13.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "estelle",
                "url": "https://github.com/estelle"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91409429?u=4e1f7b62160e72ba743c04565340fd30f04e290a&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The Firefox 151 release notes stated that style() queries allow checking for � valid CSS declaration, a CSS property, or a custom property, but browsers currently only support custom properties. This is a pre-existing spec limitation that will remain for the foreseeable future.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update the text to accurately reflect current support.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44701.\">Closes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4872838338\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44701\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44701/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44701\">#44701</a></p>",
